  "headline": "Fludarabine phosphate is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; an earlier shortage was first posted 2022-05-06 and is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D11"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show fludarabine phosphate is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; the prior shortage was first posted 2022-05-06 and is now resolved.",
      "cites": ["D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product used at Corvale General and Corvale East carries NDC 45963060955 and is labeled by Actavis Pharma, Inc. with manufacturing at ACTAVIS TOTOWA.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E3", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A separate label for Areva Pharmaceuticals names NerPharMa SRL (FEI 3004762406) as a registered manufacturing plant with a VAI inspection ending 2024-09-13.",
      "cites": ["E12"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection history for NerPharMa SRL shows multiple VAI classifications, the most recent classification letter dated 2024-12-12 for an inspection that ended 2024-09-13.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "No FDA regulatory action dated before the 2022-05-06 shortage posting is recorded for the ACTAVIS TOTOWA plant that supplies our NDC.",
      "cites": ["E6", "D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended action is to transfer 18 vials of the 50 mg/2 mL presentation from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East's supply from 4.4 days to 10 days while Corvale General retains 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
}
